---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const phone = '+17035550199';
const phoneDisplay = '(703) 555-0199';
---
<Layout title="Clogged Gutters Woodbridge, VA | Fast Cleaning" description="Clogged gutters overflowing in Woodbridge? Same-day cleaning restores flow and protects your foundation. Call (703) 555-0199.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> → Problems → Clogged Gutters</div>
      <h1>Clogged Gutters in Woodbridge</h1>
      <p>Overflowing during rain means blocked downspouts or heavy debris. Same-day cleaning restores proper flow.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container content-block">
      <p>Leaves, seed pods, and roof grit accumulate quickly under Northern Virginia trees. Once gutters and downspouts clog, water overflows, stains siding, and saturates soil against the foundation.</p>
      <h2>What We Do</h2>
      <p>We remove all debris, flush every downspout, and check for secondary issues such as failed hangers or improper pitch. Most cleanings are completed the same day you call.</p>
      <div style="margin-top:2rem;text-align:center"><a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Call {phoneDisplay}</a></div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
